{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar — welcome-offer notice and welcome prices (2026-09-28).

  1. Notice. After a shopper claims the Welcome Drop, Shopify's customer form
     sends them through /discount/CODE to the product range. This section
     confirms on that landing page that the code is saved.

  2. Welcome prices. A claimed percentage code (WELKOM10/15/20) takes its
     percentage off the product's own price at checkout. Since 2026-10-09 the
     codes do not combine with other product discounts, so when a product
     also has a sale of its own Shopify gives the shopper the better of the
     two, never both: the reduction never exceeds the code's percentage. For
     a shopper who has claimed one, every product it covers shows that final
     price everywhere it is displayed: product cards, the product page
     (price, sticky bar, badge, savings), the recently-viewed strip and the
     cart drawer's suggestions. Where the product's own sale is already the
     better deal, nothing is rewritten.

     Prices are computed here, server-side, for each code, from the product's
     own price, rounded the way Shopify rounds a percentage discount (the cut
     is truncated to the cent), and compared with the price the shop already
     shows (automatic discount from the mirror, else the product price). The
     script only picks the right numbers.

     The code's scope (the collections it applies to) is not readable from
     Liquid, so it is a setting on this section; keep it in step with the
     WELKOM codes in Admin > Discounts.

  3. Shareable discount links (2026-10-08). A shopper can also arrive through
     a link such as /discount/WELKOM20?redirect=/products/... without using
     the popup. Two ways are read so they still get the notice and the
     welcome prices:
     - the ?besjaar_offer_claimed=<10|15|20> marker in the redirect target:
       the claim now records the link's own code (the welcome-offer snippet
       records the popup's current reward, which can be a different code);
     - otherwise the codes Shopify has put on the cart (/cart.js
       discount_codes), because Shopify can drop the marker on the redirect.

  The script is inline (not deferred) so it can read the claim state and
  rewrite the price lists other sections print (data-besjaar-recent-prices,
  data-besjaar-ui-cart-range) before the deferred theme scripts read them. It
  uses the storage keys and ?besjaar_offer_claimed= marker of
  assets/besjaar-welcome-offer.js.

  4. Black Friday sign-up code (2026-11-06). Until Black Week starts the popup
     (snippets/besjaar-welcome-offer.liquid) gives VROEG20-PJX6SL instead of a
     WELKOM code: 20% off the whole order. This section did not know that code,
     so after signing up the shopper still saw the old prices everywhere. It is
     now a reward here too ("bf"): it covers every product, not only the
     welcome collections, and lasts until the code ends instead of 2 days. The
     shopper counts as signed up when they land back with
     ?besjaar_bf_signup=1, when the popup's own key is in storage, or when the
     code is on their cart. Keep bjw_bf_code and the end time in step with the
     popup snippet and with Admin > Discounts.

  The struck-through price next to a code price is the price the code takes its
  percentage off (the product price), so "20% KORTING", the struck price and the
  new price always agree, and match the cart and checkout. Before 2026-11-06 the
  compare-at price was struck through, which made 20% look like 38%.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bjw_show = settings.welcome_offer_enabled
  if customer != blank
    assign bjw_show = false
  endif
  if request.design_mode or request.visual_preview_mode
    assign bjw_show = false
  endif

  assign bjw_lang = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first | downcase
  case bjw_lang
    when 'en'
      assign bjw_title = 'Your welcome discount is applied'
      assign bjw_body = 'Code {code} ({value}) is saved and will be deducted automatically at checkout.'
      assign bjw_off = 'off'
      assign bjw_note = 'Includes your {pct}% welcome discount, applied automatically.'
      assign bjw_save = 'Save'
      assign bjw_bf_title = 'Your Black Friday discount is applied'
      assign bjw_bf_body = 'Code {code} ({value}) is on your cart and will be deducted automatically at checkout.'
      assign bjw_bf_note = 'Includes your {pct}% Black Friday discount, applied automatically.'
    when 'de'
      assign bjw_title = 'Dein Willkommensrabatt ist aktiviert'
      assign bjw_body = 'Der Code {code} ({value}) ist gespeichert und wird an der Kasse automatisch abgezogen.'
      assign bjw_off = 'Rabatt'
      assign bjw_note = 'Inkl. {pct}% Willkommensrabatt, automatisch abgezogen.'
      assign bjw_save = 'Spare'
      assign bjw_bf_title = 'Dein Black-Friday-Rabatt ist aktiviert'
      assign bjw_bf_body = 'Der Code {code} ({value}) ist in deinem Warenkorb und wird an der Kasse automatisch abgezogen.'
      assign bjw_bf_note = 'Inkl. {pct}% Black-Friday-Rabatt, automatisch abgezogen.'
    when 'fr'
      assign bjw_title = 'Votre réduction de bienvenue est appliquée'
      assign bjw_body = 'Le code {code} ({value}) est enregistré et sera déduit automatiquement au paiement.'
      assign bjw_off = 'de réduction'
      assign bjw_note = 'Remise de bienvenue de {pct}% incluse, appliquée automatiquement.'
      assign bjw_save = 'Économisez'
      assign bjw_bf_title = 'Votre réduction Black Friday est appliquée'
      assign bjw_bf_body = 'Le code {code} ({value}) est dans votre panier et sera déduit automatiquement au paiement.'
      assign bjw_bf_note = 'Réduction Black Friday de {pct}% incluse, appliquée automatiquement.'
    when 'es'
      assign bjw_title = 'Tu descuento de bienvenida está aplicado'
      assign bjw_body = 'El código {code} ({value}) está guardado y se descontará automáticamente al pagar.'
      assign bjw_off = 'de descuento'
      assign bjw_note = 'Descuento de bienvenida del {pct}% incluido, aplicado automáticamente.'
      assign bjw_save = 'Ahorra'
      assign bjw_bf_title = 'Tu descuento de Black Friday está aplicado'
      assign bjw_bf_body = 'El código {code} ({value}) está en tu carrito y se descontará automáticamente al pagar.'
      assign bjw_bf_note = 'Descuento de Black Friday del {pct}% incluido, aplicado automáticamente.'
    else
      assign bjw_title = 'Je welkomstkorting is toegepast'
      assign bjw_body = 'Code {code} ({value}) is opgeslagen en wordt automatisch verrekend bij het afrekenen.'
      assign bjw_off = 'korting'
      assign bjw_note = 'Incl. {pct}% welkomstkorting, automatisch verrekend.'
      assign bjw_save = 'Bespaar'
      assign bjw_bf_title = 'Je Black Friday-korting is toegepast'
      assign bjw_bf_body = 'Code {code} ({value}) staat op je winkelwagen en wordt automatisch verrekend bij het afrekenen.'
      assign bjw_bf_note = 'Incl. {pct}% Black Friday-korting, automatisch verrekend.'
  endcase

  assign bjw_pcts = '10,15,20' | split: ','
  assign bjw_scope = section.settings.welcome_collections | default: 'showerhead,shower-filter' | split: ','

  comment
    Black Friday sign-up code (see 4. above). Same code, percentage and end as
    bjw_bf_code / bjw_bf_starts in snippets/besjaar-welcome-offer.liquid:
    1795215600 = Sat 21 Nov 2026 00:00 Amsterdam, when the code ends in Admin
    and the popup switches off. Its percentage must be one of bjw_pcts.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_bf_code = ''
  assign bjw_bf_pct = 20
  assign bjw_bf_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  if settings.welcome_offer_bf_early_access != false and bjw_bf_now < 1795215600
    assign bjw_bf_code = 'VROEG20-PJX6SL'
  endif

  comment
    Collections to price: the welcome collections first, then (while the Black
    Friday code runs) the whole catalogue. Products only in the second part
    get "ws": false, so the WELKOM codes are never shown on them.
  endcomment
  assign bjw_lists = bjw_scope
  if bjw_bf_code != ''
    assign bjw_lists = bjw_scope | join: ',' | append: ',all' | split: ','
  endif
-%}
{%- if bjw_show -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Final price per product, variant and code percentage. "now" is the price
    the shop shows today (automatic discount from the mirror, else the product
    price); "was" is the product price, the amount the code takes its
    percentage off, struck through beside the code price. Per percentage, "w"
    says whether the code sets the price (false when the product's own
    automatic discount is the better deal, as Shopify will apply that one
    instead). "ws" is false for products outside the welcome collections.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture bjw_prices_json -%}
    {%- assign bjw_seen = '|' -%}
    {%- assign bjw_seen_scope = '|' -%}
    {%- assign bjw_count = 0 -%}
    {%- for bjw_list_handle in bjw_lists -%}
      {%- assign bjw_in_scope = true -%}
      {%- if forloop.index > bjw_scope.size -%}{%- assign bjw_in_scope = false -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign bjw_collection_handle = bjw_list_handle | strip -%}
      {%- assign bjw_collection = collections[bjw_collection_handle] -%}
      {%- if bjw_collection == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- for bjw_product in bjw_collection.products limit: 50 -%}
        {%- capture bjw_token -%}|{{ bjw_product.handle }}|{%- endcapture -%}
        {%- if bjw_seen contains bjw_token -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign bjw_seen = bjw_seen | append: bjw_token -%}
        {%- if bjw_in_scope -%}{%- assign bjw_seen_scope = bjw_seen_scope | append: bjw_token -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign bjw_first = bjw_product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: bjw_product.variants.first -%}
        {%- if bjw_count > 0 -%},{%- endif -%}
        {{ bjw_product.handle | json }}: { "id": {{ bjw_product.id }}, "first": {{ bjw_first.id }}, "ws": {{ bjw_in_scope }}, "v": {
        {%- for bjw_variant in bjw_product.variants -%}
          {%- capture bjw_auto -%}{% render 'besjaar-discount-badge', product: bjw_product, variant: bjw_variant, layout: 'cents' %}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign bjw_auto = bjw_auto | strip -%}
          {%- assign bjw_now = bjw_variant.price -%}
          {%- if bjw_auto != '' -%}{%- assign bjw_now = bjw_auto | plus: 0 -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign bjw_was = bjw_variant.price -%}
          {%- unless forloop.first -%},{%- endunless -%}
          "{{ bjw_variant.id }}": { "was": {{ bjw_was }}, "wm": {{ bjw_was | money | json }}, "p": {
          {%- for bjw_pct_text in bjw_pcts -%}
            {%- assign bjw_pct = bjw_pct_text | plus: 0 -%}
            {%- comment -%}Truncated to the cent, as Shopify does (order #SH1053: 20% of €19,99 = €3,99 off).{%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign bjw_cut = bjw_variant.price | times: bjw_pct | divided_by: 100 -%}
            {%- assign bjw_final = bjw_variant.price | minus: bjw_cut -%}
            {%- assign bjw_wins = true -%}
            {%- if bjw_now <= bjw_final -%}
              {%- assign bjw_final = bjw_now -%}
              {%- assign bjw_wins = false -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign bjw_saving = bjw_was | minus: bjw_final -%}
            {%- unless forloop.first -%},{%- endunless -%}
            "{{ bjw_pct }}": { "c": {{ bjw_final }}, "m": {{ bjw_final | money | json }}, "s": {{ bjw_saving | money | json }}, "w": {{ bjw_wins }} }
          {%- endfor -%}
          } }
        {%- endfor -%}
        } }
        {%- assign bjw_count = bjw_count | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- liquid
    comment
      Codes Shopify has actually attached to the cart (upper case). When the
      cart holds a product a code covers and that code is not among these, the
      code is not in play (used, removed or replaced) and no code price is
      shown. The WELKOM codes cover the welcome collections (cartCovered), the
      Black Friday code covers every product (cartAny).
    endcomment
    assign bjw_cart_codes = '|'
    for bjw_application in cart.discount_applications
      if bjw_application.type == 'discount_code'
        assign bjw_cart_codes = bjw_cart_codes | append: bjw_application.title | append: '|'
      endif
    endfor
    assign bjw_cart_codes = bjw_cart_codes | upcase
    assign bjw_cart_covered = false
    for bjw_item in cart.items
      capture bjw_item_token
        echo '|'
        echo bjw_item.product.handle
        echo '|'
      endcapture
      if bjw_seen_scope contains bjw_item_token
        assign bjw_cart_covered = true
      endif
    endfor
    assign bjw_cart_any = false
    if cart.item_count > 0
      assign bjw_cart_any = true
    endif
  -%}
  {{ 'besjaar-x-welcome-applied-1.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag: preload: true }}
  <div id="BesjaarWelcomeApplied" class="bj-offer-applied" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
    <span class="bj-offer-applied__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span>
    <div class="bj-offer-applied__text"><strong data-applied-title></strong><span data-applied-body></span></div>
    <button class="bj-offer-applied__close" type="button" data-applied-close aria-label="{{ 'besjaar_ui.welcome_offer.close' | t | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="BesjaarWelcomeAppliedConfig">
    {
      "title": {{ bjw_title | json }},
      "body": {{ bjw_body | json }},
      "note": {{ bjw_note | json }},
      "save": {{ bjw_save | json }},
      "regularLabel": {{ 'besjaar_ui.product.regular_price' | t | json }},
      "rewards": [
        {"id":"10","pct":10,"value":{{ '10% ' | append: bjw_off | json }},"code":{{ settings.welcome_offer_code_10 | default: 'WELKOM10' | json }}},
        {"id":"15","pct":15,"value":{{ '15% ' | append: bjw_off | json }},"code":{{ settings.welcome_offer_code_15 | default: 'WELKOM15' | json }}},
        {"id":"20","pct":20,"value":{{ '20% ' | append: bjw_off | json }},"code":{{ settings.welcome_offer_code_20 | default: 'WELKOM20' | json }}},
        {"id":"shipping","pct":0,"value":{{ 'besjaar_ui.welcome_offer.free_shipping_value' | t | json }},"code":{{ settings.welcome_offer_code_shipping | default: 'WELKOMSHIP' | json }}}
        {%- if bjw_bf_code != '' -%},
        {"id":"bf","pct":{{ bjw_bf_pct }},"all":true,"value":{{ bjw_bf_pct | append: '% ' | append: bjw_off | json }},"code":{{ bjw_bf_code | json }},"title":{{ bjw_bf_title | json }},"body":{{ bjw_bf_body | json }},"note":{{ bjw_bf_note | json }}}
        {%- endif %}
      ],
      "bfKey": "besjaar_bf_early_access_2026_v1",
      "cartCodes": {{ bjw_cart_codes | json }},
      "cartCovered": {{ bjw_cart_covered | json }},
      "cartAny": {{ bjw_cart_any | json }},
      "prices": { {{ bjw_prices_json | strip }} }
    }
  </script>
  <script src="{{ 'besjaar-x-welcome-applied-2.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Besjaar welcome notice",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Shows a short 'discount applied' confirmation after a shopper claims the Welcome Drop, and from then on shows that shopper the welcome price on every product the code covers. Until 21 November it does the same for the Black Friday sign-up code VROEG20-PJX6SL (20% on every product). It follows the Welcome offer settings in Theme settings. Keep this section in the footer group."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "welcome_collections",
      "label": "Collections the welcome codes apply to",
      "info": "Collection handles, comma-separated. Keep in step with the WELKOM codes in Admin > Discounts.",
      "default": "showerhead,shower-filter"
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["footer"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
